.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
# Anchored, because an unanchored `docs/` matches a directory of that name at
# any depth, and this repository has a second one: the site's content tree,
# whose handwritten pages are tracked. Unanchored, this rule silently shadowed
# it, so any page added there after the first commit could not be staged at all.
# The generated pages under that tree are ignored by name further down.
/docs/
STRATEGY.md
CONTEXT.md
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
